istry  says it will be establishing 15 security  posts along the border which will be run  by Syrian government forces as the clock  ticks down on the six-day hiatus between  Turkey and Russia both countries have  warned Kurdish fighters to withdraw  within 30 kilometers inside Syrian  territory Moscow says the patrol has  already begun and as battle lines become  drawn and redrawn millions of Syrians  hold their breath as Arabs and Kurds  they are waiting for peace to come to  these areas so they can return home sama  Punjabi the al-jazeera are chuckling on  the turkey-syria border
 

